# Adversary Simulation

This directory documents controlled adversary-emulation exercises conducted against systems owned and operated within the Enterprise SOC Lab.

## Platform

KALI01 serves as the dedicated adversary-simulation workstation.

## Network

KALI01 is initially isolated on:

- Network: ATTACK-NET
- VMware Network: VMnet3
- Subnet: 10.10.20.0/24
- Address: 10.10.20.10

Routing into the corporate network will be introduced through the lab firewall in a later sprint.

## Purpose

The adversary-simulation environment will be used to:

- Generate controlled malicious telemetry
- Validate SIEM detections
- Exercise SOC alert triage
- Validate MITRE ATT&CK coverage
- Conduct threat-hunting exercises
- Test incident-response procedures

All testing is restricted to systems owned and operated within the documented lab environment.
